{"id":"4c97a440c08bba55","group":"57","path":"57/57-thm-kleene-normal-form.md","title":"Kleene Normal Form Theorem","display":"thm-kleene-normal-form — Kleene Normal Form Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-thm-kleene-normal-form","aliases":["57-thm-kleene-normal-form"],"display":"thm-kleene-normal-form — Kleene Normal Form Theorem","depends_on":["[[57-df-recursive-function]]","[[57-df-phi-e]]","[[57-df-primitive-recursive]]","[[57-df-recursive-function-class]]","[[57-df-composition-operator]]","[[57-df-halt-notation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-thm-kleene-normal-form"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-thm-kleene-normal-form</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-kleene-normal-form — Kleene Normal Form Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3cca93ccf127333f\" href=\"?note=3cca93ccf127333f\" title=\"57-df-recursive-function\">57-df-recursive-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"150af883bccb8887\" href=\"?note=150af883bccb8887\" title=\"57-df-phi-e\">57-df-phi-e</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6198f000bea16af4\" href=\"?note=6198f000bea16af4\" title=\"57-df-primitive-recursive\">57-df-primitive-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4bf1a2a7d352c15e\" href=\"?note=4bf1a2a7d352c15e\" title=\"57-df-recursive-function-class\">57-df-recursive-function-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7463e44f61370c84\" href=\"?note=7463e44f61370c84\" title=\"57-df-composition-operator\">57-df-composition-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ad4b08ee803904de\" href=\"?note=ad4b08ee803904de\" title=\"57-df-halt-notation\">57-df-halt-notation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"Kleene-Normal-Form-Theorem\">Kleene Normal Form Theorem</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{PartRec}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{PartRec}_n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_n,\\operatorname{pack}_n\">\\(D_n,\\operatorname{pack}_n\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"7463e44f61370c84\" href=\"?note=7463e44f61370c84\" title=\"57-df-composition-operator\">57-df-composition-operator</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_n,U,\\varphi_e^{(n)}\">\\(T_n,U,\\varphi_e^{(n)}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"150af883bccb8887\" href=\"?note=150af883bccb8887\" title=\"57-df-phi-e\">57-df-phi-e</a> 绑定的同一实际计算编号；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}_1,\\mathrm{PartRec}_{n+1}\">\\(\\mathrm{PR}_1,\\mathrm{PartRec}_{n+1}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"6198f000bea16af4\" href=\"?note=6198f000bea16af4\" title=\"57-df-primitive-recursive\">57-df-primitive-recursive</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"4bf1a2a7d352c15e\" href=\"?note=4bf1a2a7d352c15e\" title=\"57-df-recursive-function-class\">57-df-recursive-function-class</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\simeq\">\\(\\simeq\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"ad4b08ee803904de\" href=\"?note=ad4b08ee803904de\" title=\"57-df-halt-notation\">57-df-halt-notation</a> 的部分值相等，并向部分表达式作同一图语义解释；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu s\\,T_n(e,\\vec x,s)\">\\(\\mu s\\,T_n(e,\\vec x,s)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"150af883bccb8887\" href=\"?note=150af883bccb8887\" title=\"57-df-phi-e\">57-df-phi-e</a> 的见证搜索。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span> 的输入按下式明确展开为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+1\">\\(n+1\\)</span> 个分量。</p>\n<p>原 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h(e,\\vec x)\">\\(h(e,\\vec x)\\)</span> 的调用作为展开式的记号接口保留；函数图的输入域明确为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_{n+1}\">\\(D_{n+1}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"g\\coloneqq U,\\qquad\nh\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\operatorname{pack}_{n+1}(\\langle e,x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle),z\\rangle:\ne,z\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^n\\land\n\\langle\\operatorname{pack}_n(\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle),z\\rangle\\in\\varphi_e^{(n)}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[g\\coloneqq U,\\qquad\nh\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\operatorname{pack}_{n+1}(\\langle e,x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle),z\\rangle:\ne,z\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^n\\land\n\\langle\\operatorname{pack}_n(\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle),z\\rangle\\in\\varphi_e^{(n)}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"g\\in\\mathrm{PR}_1\\land h\\in\\mathrm{PartRec}_{n+1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[g\\in\\mathrm{PR}_1\\land h\\in\\mathrm{PartRec}_{n+1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^n\\quad\nf(x_1,\\ldots,x_n)\\simeq g(\\mu s\\,T_n(e,\\operatorname{pack}_n(\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle),s))\\simeq h(e,x_1,\\ldots,x_n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^n\\quad\nf(x_1,\\ldots,x_n)\\simeq g(\\mu s\\,T_n(e,\\operatorname{pack}_n(\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle),s))\\simeq h(e,x_1,\\ldots,x_n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"h(e,\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle)\\simeq h(e,x_1,\\ldots,x_n)\n\\quad(e\\in\\mathbb N,\\ \\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[h(e,\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle)\\simeq h(e,x_1,\\ldots,x_n)\n\\quad(e\\in\\mathbb N,\\ \\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>提取函数 g 原始递归；通用部分函数 h 一般不是原始递归。原文把 h 也置于 PR 会错误地把全部部分递归函数变成总原始递归函数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Kleene-Normal-Form-Theorem","text":"Kleene Normal Form Theorem","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"3cca93ccf127333f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-recursive-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-phi-e","status":"resolved","id":"150af883bccb8887","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-phi-e]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"6198f000bea16af4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-primitive-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"4bf1a2a7d352c15e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-recursive-function-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-composition-operator","status":"resolved","id":"7463e44f61370c84","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnch